Third-party components
======================

Mesa 3D / Turnip
  Source:  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa
  Version: 26.3.0 (pinned in versions.env)
  License: MIT
  The driver binaries in the release assets are unmodified Mesa builds plus the
  two local patches in patches/. Mesa's copyright notices are retained in the
  source distribution; the binaries are stripped.

Android NDK / LLVM
  Source:  https://developer.android.com/ndk
  Version: r28c (clang 19.0.1)
  License: Apache-2.0 with LLVM exceptions (build tool only, not redistributed)

glslang
  Source:  https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glslang
  Version: 16.6.0
  License: Apache-2.0 / BSD-3-Clause (build tool only, not redistributed)

libadrenotools packaging schema
  Source:  https://github.com/bylaws/libadrenotools
  The meta.json in each package follows the ADPKG schema documented there.

